# reference) · Loads: read by security-scan only" and line 5 "Investigation prompts, not automatic vulnerability
# declarations". L0 has a single hook entry point .claude/hooks/claude-hook.mjs (events pre-bash, post-bash,
# post-edit, stop). Reviewer conventions as in M/M1.

