disp: NOT_AN_INDEPENDENT_CONSTRAINT
nature: ERROR HANDLING FOR MISCONFIGURATION (unknown event argument)
appl: actor=claude-hook.mjs main dispatch; action=report an unknown event and exit 1 (failClosed is true only for pre-bash); trigger=launch with an event argument outside pre-bash/post-bash/post-edit/stop; modality=NONE under the frozen configuration; scope=hook launcher; exceptions=host onFailure handling not verified; timing=hook start; enforcement=static code read (lines 46-61, 704-708), not executed; loading=hook code
